**Question #4a:**

Use order(scores) and print the result. Compare this output to the sort(scores) output. What is the difference?

**Answer #4a:**

sort(scores) gives you an actual numerical scores arranged from highest to lowest. While, order(scores) gives you the position number(where is highest and lowest) of where those values were in the original vector.

**Question #4b:**

